Here I was strolling around looking for a fountain, aha, here one is. First
I make water from a potion of object detection, then I start to do the same 
with a blindness potion.
Unfortunately the fountain had just disappeared. Thus, while I thought I answered
'y' to dip in fountain, I dipped a potion of blindness into the potion in slot
'y'. The result was (I credit the dev. team with imagination):

	The potions mix...  The mixture glows brightly and evaporates.

What a waste. And the vapors didn't even make me giggle.

